**CHAR32
SEQ * IE FAIL -SUCC
SUCC + S DEL
DEL * FLAG-A FLAG-B
FAIL + C G-AB
G-AB * A B
S * D A
ENDTREE
PROCESS SEQ
IMPORT
  1.000000E-01 IE I
  2.000000E-01 A
  3.000000E-01 B
  5.000000E-02 C
  4.000000E-01 D
  1.000000E+00 FLAG-A
  1.000000E+00 FLAG-B
LIMIT 1.000000E-12
**FTITLE: delete term made of two probability-1 flags
*XEQ
